Samsung announced its <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/07/22/samsung-galaxy-z-fold8/">latest foldable smartphones</a> last week, and the lineup included the Galaxy Z Fold8, a device that's close to what we're expecting Apple's foldable "<a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/iphone-ultra/">iPhone Ultra</a>" to look like when it comes out later this year. <em>MacRumors</em> videographer Dan Barbera has been testing Samsung's new foldable, and the wider 4:3 display bodes well for the &zwnj;iPhone Ultra&zwnj;.<br/>
<br/>
